<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Metway shareholders approve new name.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Metway shareholders approve new name.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metway Bank Ltd shareholders approved on Friday a change of name for the bank to Suncorp-Metway Ltd.</p>
<p>The name change will take effect from May 1 this year, chairman John Lamble told a shareholder meeting.  </p>
<p>Metway merged with the Queensland government owned Suncorp Finance and Insurance and the Queensland Industry Development Corp in November last year.</p>
<p>At 11.45 a.m. (0045 GMT), Metway shares were 14 cents down at A$5.55.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
